        "name": "Malfurion"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Being able to follow up on Muradin's Storm Bolt with a devastating burst damage combo is what makes Mages (for example Li-Ming) his ideal partners.\n\nChaining crowd control Abilities one after another is so valuable in this game that having another Hero who can provide this kind of effects from another Role (such as Blaze played as Offlaner) in your team will make Muradin a real threat for the enemy team."
  },
