    "explanation": "Heroes who can deal percent-based damage (such as Tychus via Minigun) can shred Muradin's Health very quickly, especially while in Avatar.\n\nWhen played quick enough, crowd control Abilities (for example Face Melt by E.T.C.) puts a lot of pressure on him because they can stop Dwarf Toss, his only form of escape."
